# Public research ledger heading

## Component ResearchHeading

View:
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>The research ledger</h2>
      <p>Browse reviewed outputs without inheriting the private control plane. Every future record will cite its source snapshot, evidence, verifier, and publication decision.</p>
    </div>

Style:
    .section-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        justify-content: space-between;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .section-head > * {
        flex: 1 1 300px;
    }
    .section-head h2 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #123342;
        font: 730 clamp(28px,4vw,42px)/1.05 Georgia, serif;
        letter-spacing: -.025em;
    }
    .section-head p {
        max-width: 520px;
        margin: 0;
        color: #69767c;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
